# Sacred Platform UI

The whole app (auth + in-app) uses the dark Sacred theme from `src/theme.ts`:

- Background `#0a0a0c`, chrome buttons `#c9ccd1`, text `#f2f3f5`, links `#a8b0ff`
- Use `sharedStyles` / `Screen` / `BrandWatermark` — do not reintroduce white page backgrounds
- Prefer `colors` from `src/theme.ts` over hard-coded hex

## Title Case

Every **screen title**, **nav header**, and **section heading** must capitalize the first letter of each word.

```tsx
// ❌ BAD
<Text style={sharedStyles.title}>Create your account</Text>

// ✅ GOOD
<Text style={sharedStyles.title}>Create Your Account</Text>
```

`sharedStyles.title` already sets `textTransform: 'capitalize'`.
